Description: XCM HRMP Channels - Verify cross-chain messaging channels
Network: ../zombienet-configs/local-dev.toml
Creds: config

# ============================================
# Prerequisites
# ============================================

# All collators must be up
asset-hub-collator1: is up
people-collator1: is up
bulletin-collator1: is up

# All parachains must be registered and producing blocks
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1500 is registered within 400 seconds
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1502 is registered within 400 seconds
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1501 is registered within 400 seconds

# Wait for parachains to produce some blocks (HRMP channels need time to open)
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1500 block height is at least 5 within 500 seconds
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1502 block height is at least 5 within 500 seconds
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1501 block height is at least 5 within 500 seconds

# ============================================
# HRMP Channel Verification
# ============================================

# Verify all XCM channels are open:
# - People (1502) <-> Bulletin (1501)
# - People (1502) <-> Asset Hub (1500)
asset-hub-collator1: js-script ./scripts/dist/test-xcm-channels.js return is equal to 1 within 600 seconds
